  "scope": "Three complete verbatim methods: both ResourceBuilder::hashFile overloads and CodeDirectory::multipleHashFileData. CoreFoundation, xattr and fcntl declarations use the host SDK. Private file/hash/ref-counting helpers, scanFileData and error values are declaration-only shims. AST records digest selection, one-pass shared input and sideband ordering, not runtime execution or full Security compilation. Existing writer/allocation AST and independent native bundle captures qualify transfer, mutation limits and commit effects. No aggregate 1 GiB limit is inferred from these bodies alone.",
